{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6c7265cfe45aef25","name":"Espionage Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-6c7265cfe45aef25","title":"Espionage Talent Tree","revision":21173,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:17:53Z","sha256":"166a6441b7be4666556c392367017530a9f137dd2b829b04849f6ad7910e5d37","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21173","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Espionage%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6c7265cfe45aef25","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use your knowledge of stealth and survival to make yourself a master of espionage and a valuable resource for those who wish to keep their hands clean in dirty situations.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fade Out"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to make yourself scarce when dealing with suspicious or hostile beings. You can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," skill, not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Create a Diversion to Hide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Create_a_Diversion_to_Hide"},". If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," skill, you gain a +5 bonus to your skill check for the purpose of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Creating a Diversion to Hide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Creating_a_Diversion_to_Hide"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Keep Together"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are hit or missed by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", provided that you end your movement adjacent to an ally. This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Prudent Escape"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you reduce a target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or otherwise render a creature unconscious, you can choose two allies within 6 squares of you and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You and the allies you chose can immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeds"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeds"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reactive Stealth"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are missed by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," and have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from the attacker, you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to half your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check to become hidden from your attacker, provided you still have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," at the end of your movement.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sizing Up"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of a single target that is within 6 squares of you and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". If you succeed, you gain a +2 insight bonus to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and attack rolls against the target until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
